        <mxCell id="lisflow-result-c7" value="&lt;b&gt;1 · แล็บออกไฟล์ .res&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;ผลอาจทยอยมาหลายครั้ง — preliminary → final · sensitivity มาทีหลัง identification&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=light-dark(#333333,#e0e0e0);fillColor=light-dark(#d5e8d4,#1e3a1c);strokeColor=light-dark(#82b366,#82b366);spacingTop=2;spacingLeft=2;spacingBottom=2;spacingRight=2;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="lisflow-result-c3">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="25" width="250" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lisflow-result-c8" value="&lt;b&gt;2 · อ่าน .res + จับคู่ใบสั่ง&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;จับคู่ด้วย &lt;b&gt;labno&lt;/b&gt; → ส่งกลับในชื่อ filler_order_no&lt;br&gt;คำนวณ overall_status · result_uid = &quot;rpt-&quot; + id ถาวรของแถวรายงาน&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=light-dark(#333333,#e0e0e0);fillColor=light-dark(#dae8fc,#16334d);strokeColor=light-dark(#6c8ebf,#6c8ebf);spacingTop=2;spacingLeft=2;spacingBottom=2;spacingRight=2;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="lisflow-result-c4">
          <mxGeometry x="360" y="25" width="250" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lisflow-result-c9" value="&lt;b&gt;3 · POST {baseUrl}/v1/process/{pid}&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;process: &lt;b&gt;hl7_result_upsert&lt;/b&gt; · Auth: Bearer JWT&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=light-dark(#333333,#e0e0e0);fillColor=light-dark(#dae8fc,#16334d);strokeColor=light-dark(#6c8ebf,#6c8ebf);spacingTop=2;spacingLeft=2;spacingBottom=2;spacingRight=2;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="lisflow-result-c4">
          <mxGeometry x="660" y="25" width="250" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lisflow-result-c10" value="&lt;b&gt;4 · POST {baseUrl}/v1/process/{pid ที่ 2}&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;process: &lt;b&gt;hl7_order_status_sync&lt;/b&gt; — คนละ pid กับผล&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=light-dark(#333333,#e0e0e0);fillColor=light-dark(#dae8fc,#16334d);strokeColor=light-dark(#6c8ebf,#6c8ebf);spacingTop=2;spacingLeft=2;spacingBottom=2;spacingRight=2;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="lisflow-result-c4">
          <mxGeometry x="660" y="105" width="250" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lisflow-result-c11" value="&lt;b&gt;5 · ตรวจ JWT + จับคู่ใบสั่ง&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;cross-check &lt;b&gt;order_no + filler_order_no + visit_id&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;🔴 ห้าม match ด้วย HN หรือ LAB NO. เพียงค่าเดียว&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=light-dark(#333333,#e0e0e0);fillColor=light-dark(#e1d5e7,#33254a);strokeColor=light-dark(#9673a6,#9673a6);spacingTop=2;spacingLeft=2;spacingBottom=2;spacingRight=2;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="lisflow-result-c5">
          <mxGeometry x="960" y="25" width="250" height="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lisflow-result-c12" value="&lt;b&gt;6 · upsert ด้วย result_uid&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;มี result_uid นี้แล้ว → created:false ไม่สร้างแถวใหม่&lt;br&gt;จับ item ด้วย obs_code = his_code_id&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=light-dark(#333333,#e0e0e0);fillColor=light-dark(#e1d5e7,#33254a);strokeColor=light-dark(#9673a6,#9673a6);spacingTop=2;spacingLeft=2;spacingBottom=2;spacingRight=2;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="lisflow-result-c5">
